# Nastor AI Studio — server-only Fadr configuration
# Set these secrets in the Vercel project environment settings.
# Never put real values in Git, local screenshots, or browser-side NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables.

# Obtain this API key from Fadr's API tab:
FADR_API_KEY=

# Generate a long RANDOM access token separate from your Fadr API key.
# The beta Stem Lab prompts for this code to authorize operations.
# Before public rollout replace the beta token with real signed-in user sessions,
# account-level billing limits, abuse protection and per-project task permissions.
FADR_STUDIO_ACCESS_TOKEN=
